# Unreal build output and caches, all rebuilt locally.
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
# The material is generated by Scripts/make_star_material.py.
Content/Generated/
# The catalogue staged for packaging, and each developer's signing team.
Content/Data/
Config/User*.ini
*.xcworkspace/
# Info.plist template generated by UnrealBuildTool.
Build/IOS/UBTGenerated/
# The commit being built, written by stellar.sh.
Source/StellarExplorer/BuildStamp.inl
# The repository's Python "build/" rule hides Unreal's Build/ folder on a case-insensitive
# file system; the Mac's Info.plist template and entitlements in it are source.
!/Build/
/Build/*
!/Build/Mac/
# Written there by packaging, not source.
/Build/Mac/app.PackageVersionCounter
/Build/Mac/Resources/Sandbox.*.entitlements
